_This document was generated to formally close out Section 11 of B5 — Authentication and Authorization Architecture. Items marked [Inference] in individual ADRs above are reasoning steps derived from confirmed facts in B5 or from standard, widely-recognized design tradeoffs; they are not independently verified against this specific deployment's measured behavior or traffic. Items marked [Unverified] indicate no reliable source was available and no claim is made. This document does not itself constitute production sign-off — ADR-AUTH-02's benchmarking requirement and ADR-AUTH-07's alert-threshold tuning remain outstanding operational tasks, and ADR-AUTH-08 remains fully unresolved pending vendor research._